    "In Live mode with Claude, the text of what you say and, when this is on, a reduced copy (1024 px) of the picture on screen are sent to Anthropic, with your key — never the audio. Outside Live mode, nothing is sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Live mode with Claude, the text of what you say and, when this is on, a reduced copy (1024 px) of the picture on screen are sent to Anthropic, with your key — never the audio. Outside Live mode, nothing is sent."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En mode Live avec Claude, le texte de ce que tu dis et, si c'est activé, une copie réduite (1024 px) de l'image affichée sont envoyés à Anthropic, avec ta clé — jamais l'audio. Hors du mode Live, rien n'est envoyé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Live mode with Claude, these are sent to Anthropic to answer you, with your own API key: what you say or type during Live (the text, never the audio); the list of your edits and their settings; what the iPhone recognised in the picture (for example “1 person in the centre, a dog on the left”); the text in your photo or video and a few sentences spoken in the video around the playhead; if you allow it, a reduced copy (1024 px) of the photo or video frame on screen, without location or camera data. Your voice is transcribed on the iPhone: the audio never leaves the device. Outside Live mode, nothing is sent. Anthropic keeps this data according to its privacy policy, and usage is billed to your Anthropic account. You can stop at any time with the End button or in Settings › Live.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Live mode with Claude, these are sent to Anthropic to answer you, with your own API key: what you say or type during Live (the text, never the audio); the list of your edits and their settings; what the iPhone recognised in the picture (for example “1 person in the centre, a dog on the left”); the text in your photo or video and a few sentences spoken in the video around the playhead; if you allow it, a reduced copy (1024 px) of the photo or video frame on screen, without location or camera data. Your voice is transcribed on the iPhone: the audio never leaves the device. Outside Live mode, nothing is sent. Anthropic keeps this data according to its privacy policy, and usage is billed to your Anthropic account. You can stop at any time with the End button or in Settings › Live."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En mode Live avec Claude, ces éléments sont envoyés à Anthropic pour te répondre, avec ta propre clé API : ce que tu dis ou écris pendant Live (le texte, jamais l'audio) ; la liste de tes retouches et leurs réglages ; ce que l'iPhone a reconnu dans l'image (par exemple « 1 personne au centre, un chien à gauche ») ; les textes présents dans ta photo ou ta vidéo et quelques phrases prononcées dans la vidéo autour de la tête de lecture ; si tu l'autorises, une copie réduite (1024 px) de la photo ou de l'image vidéo affichée, sans localisation ni données de l'appareil photo. Ta voix est transcrite sur l'iPhone : l'audio ne quitte jamais l'appareil. Hors du mode Live, rien n'est envoyé. Anthropic conserve ces données selon sa politique de confidentialité, et l'usage est facturé sur ton compte Anthropic. Tu peux arrêter à tout moment avec le bouton Fin ou dans Réglages › Live."
          }
        }
      }
    },
