    "PicShop works entirely on your iPhone. If you add a Claude key in Settings › Live, Live mode sends Anthropic the text of what you say and, if you allow it, a reduced copy of the picture — never the audio. Outside Live mode, nothing is sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PicShop works entirely on your iPhone. If you add a Claude key in Settings › Live, Live mode sends Anthropic the text of what you say and, if you allow it, a reduced copy of the picture — never the audio. Outside Live mode, nothing is sent."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PicShop fonctionne entièrement sur ton iPhone. Si tu ajoutes une clé Claude dans Réglages › Live, le mode Live envoie à Anthropic le texte de ce que tu dis et, si tu l'acceptes, une copie réduite de l'image — jamais l'audio. Hors du mode Live, rien n'est envoyé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PicShop writes down what is said. Strike words and they leave the video.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PicShop writes down what is said. Strike words and they leave the video."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PicShop écrit ce qui est dit. Barrez des mots : ils quittent la vidéo."
