    "The report says what PicShop was doing, including your last commands, with the device model and free memory. No photos, videos or recordings. It leaves your iPhone only if you share it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The report says what PicShop was doing, including your last commands, with the device model and free memory. No photos, videos or recordings. It leaves your iPhone only if you share it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le rapport indique ce que faisait PicShop, y compris vos dernières commandes, avec le modèle de l'appareil et la mémoire libre. Aucune photo, vidéo ni enregistrement. Il ne quitte votre iPhone que si vous le partagez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
